  "description": "One day, writer Ppallu wakes up in a fantasy world. She used to just draw webtoons, but she had a chance to start a new life. Now Ppallu gives reviews to her friends about popular webtoons. A parody of the shoujo projects and funny retellings of Kakao Page’s popular projects on behalf of Ppallu.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/59357585), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%9B%B9%ED%88%B0-%EC%9E%91%EA%B0%80%EA%B0%80-%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0%EC%96%B4%EB%A1%9C-%EB%B9%99%EC%9D%98%ED%95%9C-%EA%B1%B4%EC%97%90-%EB%8C%80%ED%95%B4/4707)",
